{"availability":"available","full":"netcanon/netcanon","name":"netcanon","description":"Multi-vendor network config translator — Cisco / Juniper / Fortinet / Aruba / Arista / MikroTik / OPNsense. Cross-mesh audit catches silent translation errors before they ship. Live demo: demo.netcanon.net","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":11,"forks":1,"created":"2026-05-13T06:20:23Z","updated":"2026-10-15T21:57:22Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://demo.netcanon.net","topics":["arista","aruba","cisco","config-migration","fastapi","fortinet","juniper","mikrotik","network-automation","network-configuration","opnsense","python","vendor-translation"],"demo":"https://demo.netcanon.net/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:18.020Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:18.020Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:18.020Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:12:24.129Z","stars":11,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-08T07:32:11.662Z","stars":11,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-10T07:03:18.866Z","stars":11,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:46:18.020Z","stars":11,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Multi-vendor network config translator with a verifiable cross-vendor audit.","Built for switches and routers. Translates running-config across Cisco (IOS-XE, NX-OS, IOS-XR), Juniper Junos, Arista EOS, Aruba (AOS-S, AOS-CX), Dell SmartFabric OS10, MikroTik RouterOS, and VyOS.","What sets it apart is the audit underneath. Every supported vendor pair × every field gets classified into one of eight variance classes (ALIGNED / CODECBUG / EXPECTEDLOSSY / EXPECTEDUNSUPPORTED / METHODOLOGYISSUEunder / METHODOLOGYISSUEover / STRUCTURALONLY / TRIVIALEMPTY). The cross-mesh audit catches silent translation errors — the kind that produce output that looks valid but quietly drops or transforms a field — before they ship."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/netcanon/netcanon/blob/main/README.